  "name": {
   "zh": "摄影机与深度 · MonST3R",
   "en": "Camera and Depth · MonST3R"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "MonST3R 官方自述：以前馈为主处理动态视频，给出随时间变化的动态点云，以及每帧摄影机的位姿和内参。这张卡交付摄影机（USD 与 Nuke 摄影机）、深度贴图和它附带的运动物体遮罩；不出点云（整段点云是它的优化器用深度反投影的），要点云接「深度转点云」。",
   "en": "MonST3R describes itself as a mainly feed-forward approach to dynamic video, giving a time-varying dynamic point cloud and per-frame camera poses and intrinsics. This card delivers the camera (USD and Nuke camera), depth maps and its moving-object masks; no point cloud (its whole-shot point cloud is back-projected from depth by its optimizer), so wire Points from Depth if you need one."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_long",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
